    {
      "blockId": "tour:body:47f6c11f40afc686",
      "field": "body",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b3435e497514017c706d70ddd69d10dd86e10881eb752c9a61f138be1c3db607",
      "text": "From highland markets to the Caribbean coast, this journey brings together Guatemala and Belize in 12 days. In Chichicastenango, you will explore the traditional market and prepare corn dishes with local women. At Lake Atitlán, a boat takes you to two Tz’utujil Maya villages, before the route continues through Iximché and colonial Antigua to Petén.\n\nYou will visit Tikal with a guide, with lunch served inside the archaeological site. After the overland journey into Belize, you will stay at Hidden Valley and have a free day among the forests. The trip ends on Ambergris Caye, where you can relax by the Caribbean Sea.\n\n## Hotel options\n\n| Destination | Option A | Option B |\n|---|---|---|\n| Guatemala City | Hyatt Centric | Barceló |\n| Lake Atitlán | Hotel Atitlán | Villa Santa Catarina |\n| Antigua | Casa Santo Domingo | Villa Colonial |\n| Petén | Villa Maya | Villa Maya |\n| San Ignacio / Hidden Valley | Hidden Valley | Hidden Valley |\n| Ambergris Caye | Victoria House | Victoria House |\n\n## Group tour: rates per person, USD\n\nSaturday departures, with a group of 2 to 16 travellers.\n\n| Package | Base DBL | Single supplement | Triple reduction |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Option A | 3333 | 1803 | 275 |\n| Option B | 2871 | 1480 | 192 |\n\nSGL is a supplement to the base rate. Triple rooms are available in Guatemala only, subject to availability; the calculation of the reduction for the full package is confirmed when you book. Hotels in Belize offer rooms with one bed only; an extra-bed supplement applies if needed.\n\n## Private tour: rates per person, USD\n\nDaily departures. Prices apply to the stated number of travellers.\n\n| Package | 2–3 people | 4–5 people | 6–7 people | 8–10 people |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Option A | 4486 | 3951 | 3872 | 3728 |\n| Option B | 3985 | 3436 | 3357 | 3213 |\n\n## Flights and booking conditions\n\nFlights are charged separately. Guatemala City – Flores: USD 165 per person one way, with up to 50 lb of baggage. The supplement list also includes Santa Elena / Flores – Belize City: USD 135 per person one way, with up to 50 lb of baggage. However, the main itinerary on Day 8 crosses the border overland. Whether the second flight is needed, and the final transport arrangements, will be confirmed before payment.\n\nOn Day 12, the programme includes a flight from Ambergris Caye to Belize City to connect with your international flight. The price for this leg and its baggage allowance are confirmed when you book.\n\nRates are valid for 2027, except 20–28 March 2027 and 15 December 2027 – 4 January 2028. Prices, availability and your selected hotels are confirmed before booking. Additional excursions to Pacaya, Yaxhá and Caracol are charged separately.\n",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "ChatGPT",
        "runId": "ada-en-821a3075e51e-worker",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word has itinerary and tariff tables, but no single matching website body and no equivalent wording that reconciles its listed Flores–Belize flight with the Day 8 land crossing, confirms the full-package triple reduction or requests the Day 12 flight price before booking. Translated the current RU body including those explicit qualifications, preserving every hotel, rate, supplement, date, group size and transport condition. Word tariff and hotel tables were read and their values match the RU body.",
